<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto">On Fri, Dec 14, 2018 at 1:22 PM, Darren Enenstein &lt;<a href=3D"m=
ailto:dse@enensteinlaw.com">dse@enensteinlaw.com</a>&gt; wrote:<o:p></o:p><=
/p>
<blockquote style=3D"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-bottom:5.0pt">
<div>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">Steve,</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">Extortion in California is define=
d as:</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">Under<b=
>Penal Code 518</b> PC, the California crime of<b>extortion</b> (also known=
 as &quot;<b>blackmail</b>&quot;) occurs when&nbsp;a person
 does any of the following:</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto;margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in">
<span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">1.</span><span l=
ang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:7.0pt;color:#777777">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
</span><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">uses forc=
e or threats to compel another person to give you money or other
 property,</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto;margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in">
<span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">2.</span><span l=
ang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:7.0pt;color:#777777">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
</span><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">uses forc=
e or threats to compel a public officer to perform an official act,
 or</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto;margin-left:.5in;text-indent:-.25in">
<span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">3.</span><span l=
ang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:7.0pt;color:#777777">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;=
</span><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">if it is =
a public official, acts under color of official right to compel
 another person to give up money or other property.<sup>1</sup></span><o:p>=
</o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt;color:#777777">This ma=
y sound fairly complicated. And, in fact, California<b>extortion</b> charge=
s can be brought in a wide variety of scenarios.
 &nbsp;Just a few<b>examples</b> of behavior that could be considered extor=
tion/blackmail under California law include:</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<ul type=3D"disc">
<li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"color:#777777;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-=
margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">
<span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">A man armed with a knife break=
s into a home and threatens to kill the home's owner if she doesn't open a =
safe that contains large amounts of cash and expensive jewelry;</span><o:p>=
</o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"color:#777777;mso-margin-top-al=
t:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-list:l0 level1 lfo1">
<span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">A real estate developer threat=
ens to expose a city council member's extramarital affair to the media if t=
he city council member does not vote to approve a project that the develope=
r wants to build; and</span><o:p></o:p></li><li class=3D"MsoNormal" style=
=3D"color:#777777;mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-alt:auto;mso-li=
st:l0 level1 lfo1">
<span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">An adult daughter with a drug =
problem threatens to accuse her father of molesting her and have him arrest=
ed if he does not give her money to buy drugs.<sup>2</sup></span><o:p></o:p=
></li></ul>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">Is Tara seeking money or property=
?</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">Separately, if Tara is threatenin=
g her that her boyfriend will attack Steve at an unknown later date, is thi=
s an assault?</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">In California an assault is defin=
ed as</span><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">,, under Penal Cod=
e 240, as: An assault is an unlawful attempt,
 coupled with a present ability, to commit a violent injury on the person o=
f another.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">I believe the present=
 ability part is not satisfied.</span><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">Steve, there may be a=
dditional facts I don=E2=80=99t have.&nbsp; Let me know.</span><o:p></o:p><=
/p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">&nbsp;</span><o:p></o=
:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span lang=3D"EN" style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">Thanks,</span><o:p></=
o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"mso-margin-top-alt:auto;mso-margin-bottom-a=
lt:auto"><span style=3D"font-size:14.0pt">^</span><o:p></o:p></p>
